  "description": "Young-woon, whose life has lost meaning due to frustrated dreams and depression, is caught up in a mysterious infection and trapped in the \"Eugene Building\" with his friend Sang-gu. The isolated individuals struggle for survival, sparking conflict. A month passes in despair and chaos... Will Young-woon survive this place?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list.nhn?titleId=838555), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=12525582) \n\n**Official Translations:**    \n[Japanese](https://manga.line.me/product/periodic?id=Z0003935)",
